<title>VENEZUELA: Corimon year net rises.</title>
<headline>Corimon year net rises.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Net 3.474 billion bolivars profit vs 105.773 million bolivars loss</p>
<p>Revs 67.204 billion bolivars vs 93.147 billion bolivars</p>
<p>NOTES: Period ending 31 March, 1997</p>
<p>Results are inflation adjusted</p>
<p>Corimon CA is a paints and packaging company</p>
<p>Corimon underwent a substantial restructuring in 1996 after running into financial difficulties</p>
<p>The company's debts were re-capitalized by creditors through a share issue</p>
<p>((-- Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600)</p>
</text>
